{"seed":9982,"ability":"fear_aura","action":"menace","context":"social","position":"A","target":"gen_ml0ldy4","dayTicksBefore":507,"dayPartBefore":3,"grantOk":true,"grantMethod":"abilities-push","openingKcal":47250,"result":true,"resultError":null,"sayLines":["💬 A person, maybe 20s is with A woman, maybe 50s, talking the way people do when nobody else is listening.","📖 the woman in her 30s, with a wiry build is walking the woman in her 40s through a shrubby tree with smooth peeling bark and round yellow-green fragrant fruit — leaf, stem, smell, the beginner's tour.","\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 50s settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 50s.)","Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell.","🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do.","Overnight the bank burns −500 kcal. Feast again, or spend it.","Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A woman, maybe 30s, with a nervous tic is staring into the fire like it owes them answers.","A woman, maybe 30s, with ink-stained fingers traded something with someone for something else. The barter economy stirs.","Daniyar and Zainab lingered over the fire together.","Grace and Mai lingered over the fire together.","Lena and Stan lingered over the fire together.","🔧 Technique learned: tick removal.","A woman, maybe 50s watches you scratch at your ankle and shakes their head. “Here — tweezers at the head, steady pull, don’t twist. Like this.” (You learned tick removal.)","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 the woman in her 30s, with a nervous tic, the veterinarian talks about wanting to belong somewhere the way people talk about weather — often, and with no plans to change it. The real wanting is somewhere they keep not looking.","📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A woman, maybe 30s, with a nervous tic).","👀 the man in his 50s pronounced a Denver place-name the way someone reads it off a map for the first time. Nobody from there says it that way.","📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A man, maybe 50s).","You don't raise a hand. You don't need to. Your point lands — they'll remember the look on your face, and not fondly. (Menace)","📓 Journal: you UNDERSTAND **Dread**. It resonates with: something unnamed.","(−120 kcal — food becomes fear aura.)"],"dayBefore":1,"dayAfter":2,"spanLogged":true,"spanCrossed":true,"spanInternalDraws":11,"nestEvents":[{"evt":1,"kind":"spanEnter","ability":"fear_aura","action":"menace","day":1,"depth":0,"directBefore":0},{"evt":2,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":200,"frames":["Object.villageMeal","Game.villageMeal","G.<computed>","G.villageMeal","Object.wrappedVillageMeal","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":3,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":200,"taken":400,"items":[{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":400,"units":1,"spoilDay":31}]},{"evt":4,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":537,"frames":["Object.villagerMealDay","G.villagerMealDay","Object.wrappedMealDay","Object.villageEats","G.villageEats","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":5,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":537,"taken":400,"items":[{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":400,"units":1,"spoilDay":31}]},{"evt":6,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":567,"frames":["Object.villagerMealDay","G.villagerMealDay","Object.wrappedMealDay","Object.villageEats","G.villageEats","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":7,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":567,"taken":400,"items":[{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":400,"units":1,"spoilDay":31}]},{"evt":8,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":1015,"frames":["Object.villagerM